# Golden-path web (Cursor adapter)

1. Read `projects/golden-path/AGENTS.md` and `projects/golden-path/apps/web/AGENTS.md`.
2. Server-first pages; smallest client boundary; browser code uses the typed client only.
3. Prisma / `DATABASE_URL` are server-only — never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` secrets.
4. Do not add auth, payment, email, AI, or new capability packs without an approved capability task.
5. Verify: `pnpm --filter @safrs/web` lint/typecheck/test/build; `pnpm test:e2e` when journeys change.
